{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"**Both J2 failures stand. One reader call could change the separating test by a point, and the frozen gold regression stands independently.**\n\n- **Verdicts.** I reproduced 2/24 for J2a, 4/24 for J2b, and four net repairs against five with no controls lost in the separating test. The close call is C100. The archived filing gives a $25B balance, and the reporting gives $18B committed for the rest of the year. Neither establishes that all $18B comes out of that balance before filing. Both readers leaned on that assumption when rejecting the $20–25B forecast. Recheck C100 independently against those sources and keep the recorded score until adjudication. The China-share miss is real against the frozen 1–8% range, although the request contains conflicting H200 conclusions and the answers still weigh both. [C100](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/poc/data/hybrid-2026-11-20/deck-full/C100.txt:83) · [DESIGN-J2.md:280](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-20-hybrid/DESIGN-J2.md:280)\n- **One recommendation for Alex.** Keep the previous forecast and its reasons intact. The block already follows the evidence. Change only its heading to “Earlier assessment and carried evidence. Derive today’s forecast afresh.” This preserves what D198 carries. [judging.py:156](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/src/hivemind/views/judging.py:156)\n- **One test.** Freeze 13 fresh targets and eight matched controls. Send three paired repeats against same-day v7 and blind-read all answers. Require five net repairs jointly supported in two of three repeats, zero supported controls lost, and no extra refusals. Require frozen-gold agreement at least as high as v7’s, with d3-q17 agreeing three times and its reasons checked against both H200 conclusions.\n- **Skip the full-window replay** until a candidate clears that screen. Replaying retired arms or tuning again on exposed cases would leave the decision unchanged.\n\nCONSENSUS: Ask Alex to approve one presentation-only test on fresh cases, with the previous reasoning intact and d3-q17 protected."}}
